# ===========================================================================
# Repository-root ignore rules.
#
# Code/.gitignore holds the detailed application rules. This file is the
# belt-and-braces layer: a leaked broker credential in git history is a
# total-loss event, so the .env patterns are repeated here to cover every
# directory, not just Code/.
# ===========================================================================

# --- SECRETS: never commit, anywhere in the tree ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
# Secret DATA files — deliberately enumerated by extension rather than written
# as `**/secrets.*`.
#
# That glob was the original rule, and it silently excluded
# `src/algotrader/common/secrets.py` — the module implementing SecretString,
# i.e. safety invariant #3. The file was never committed, so the package could
# not be imported from a clean clone and the repository had never actually
# built anywhere except the machine it was written on. Nothing caught it for
# the entire project, because every test run happened where the file existed.
# CI found it on its first run.
#
# Never re-broaden this to `secrets.*`. Source code is not a secret; secret
# VALUES are, and they live in the formats below.
**/secrets.yaml
**/secrets.yml
**/secrets.json
**/secrets.toml
**/secrets.env
**/secrets.txt
**/secrets.ini
*.sops.yaml
!*.sops.example.yaml
age.key
.age/
**/credentials*.json
**/token*.json
**/session*.json

# --- Market data & trade records: stay local ---
**/data/historical/*
**/data/archive/*
!**/data/historical/.gitkeep
!**/data/archive/.gitkeep
*.parquet
*.duckdb
*.sqlite
*.db
backtest_results/
validation_reports/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*
dist/
build/

# --- Node (Code/Test.js placeholder) ---
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# --- Ops ---
*.log
logs/
docker-compose.override.yml

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json

# --- OneDrive sync artefacts ---
*.tmp
~$*
